  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, <math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>′</mo> </mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />The above expression it is clear that <math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is increasing in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> and decreasing in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
